matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-71731/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-71731"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id "q-71734/selection/de9ee349f9504eb1613cb80308cc4d18e5042eaa5ee74cb886ba7d6dc9d1681e" :answer/id #uuid "22d5c4e8-a2a7-5a53-b2af-18026d9aeaec" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71734/selection/6920db53e608e30ca80723adc71a9309a43f3d86a24f02c00f7986318ce6b115" :answer/id #uuid "1103ed34-4d7b-5903-918b-866afdeb28a6" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & -1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71734/selection/d27220c933d10071d6537f9f1af878ba76a2c68391a46ead8531822af2fdac40" :answer/id #uuid "6fcfd152-77eb-535d-8cc5-6693c1307366" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ 1 & 1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71734/selection/8777fe2f6e80ce50c7bbd208e5d3c9b9337fa428656fd6ac0944f9e887087102" :answer/id #uuid "1b0efe35-31d7-5eff-be30-ccde9407f796" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 \\\\ -1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71734/selection/a0d5f2813fe9be08e6b038045d18635a4348a4ae4c1900fe4a96b834a4484bc7" :answer/id #uuid "bf25ff89-86a7-52af-9645-b89068adafbe" :answer/type :answer.type/math :answer/value "[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]" :db/ensure [:answer/validate]} {:db/id "q-71734/selection" :answer-field/id #uuid "ca53d8d4-2e44-59a5-82db-f9534abedfd0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/radio :answer-field/correct "q-71734/selection/de9ee349f9504eb1613cb80308cc4d18e5042eaa5ee74cb886ba7d6dc9d1681e" :answer-field/choices ["q-71734/selection/de9ee349f9504eb1613cb80308cc4d18e5042eaa5ee74cb886ba7d6dc9d1681e" "q-71734/selection/6920db53e608e30ca80723adc71a9309a43f3d86a24f02c00f7986318ce6b115" "q-71734/selection/d27220c933d10071d6537f9f1af878ba76a2c68391a46ead8531822af2fdac40" "q-71734/selection/8777fe2f6e80ce50c7bbd208e5d3c9b9337fa428656fd6ac0944f9e887087102" "q-71734/selection/a0d5f2813fe9be08e6b038045d18635a4348a4ae4c1900fe4a96b834a4484bc7"] :db/ensure [:answer-field/validate]} {:db/id "q-71734" :question/id #uuid "7672ad95-6ea9-52fb-8430-2348e98b218a" :question/math-academy-id "q-71734" :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{\\begin{aligned}u-v=-1 \\\\ -u-v=1\\end{aligned}\\end{aligned}\n$$" :question/worked-solution "Notice that the system is already organized so that the variables are in the order $u,v$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient.   \n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables: \n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}1 & -1 & -1 \\\\ -1 & -1 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/easy :question/answer-fields ["q-71734/selection"] :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:knowledge-point/id #uuid "14d047c8-f032-5ff3-aced-65d40bfeeaad"] :knowledge-point/questions ["q-71734"] :db/ensure [:knowledge-point/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-4683"] :question/problem "What is the coefficient matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/14671e805c18814b31d0c65d0e53c60aae1cf52c60ad8dd146d8a3f4bc823915.png)" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that every variable has a coefficient:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/e0318c549ab4aa25bf2decb41e45e296406d699706c03aff7ea44724d20edece.png)\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & -2 \\\n\t\t0 & 2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-4684"] :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/a5abba041a61cad76d43d5bb13d0fd4e873eb2daf2282e8d9828b8ab79fe2ba0.png)" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $x,y,z$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/2f9ae37920ec528a700715658900bbbf3ec4c855767bf06f79d044f488a8bbf2.png)\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n\\left\\lbrack\n\t\\matrix {\n\t\t1 & 1 & -3 \\\n\t\t-7 & -1 & 1 \\\n                2 & 1 & -2 \n\t}\n\t\\right\\rbrack\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix  is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/af1499610c0c312a1f5c50d99967a004ae6b3042c3a88ca20a86f922b28aaaff.png)" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-4685"] :question/problem "What would be the system of equations for the following augmented matrix?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/4d90e81043121495ae8bb7742400b2c9e705cb7d706f553a6ab2aec44b35d017.png)" :question/worked-solution "The augmented matrix consists of two parts: the coefficient matrix and the column of constants.\n\nThe coefficient matrix represents the coefficients in the linear system, while the column of constants represents the constants on the right-hand sides of the equations.\n\nUsing the variables $x$ and $y,$ then, the corresponding system of equations is\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/3e7f783023405be3ea79a740998fefac3a6ea909e9903f5ea300a9234ae63003.png)" :db/ensure [:question/validate]} {:db/id [:question/math-academy-id "e-4686"] :question/problem "What is the augmented matrix for the following system of linear equations?\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/d89417b7eb2d000bbd81fcf4a89ca7eaa5529fc56d9b41bf6e8bb237d2eb9e16.png)" :question/worked-solution "First, we organize the system so that the variables are ordered $a,b,c,d$ on the left-hand side, the constants are on the right-hand side, and every variable has a coefficient:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/93874fa93cfd9ef3df1492bbc35056c2381157740d8ca26b475474faf54ee4d1.png)\n\nThe coefficient matrix consists of the coefficients of the variables:\n\n$$\n[\\begin{aligned}-1 & 0 & \\frac{1}{2} & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & -4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 1\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nThe augmented matrix is the coefficient matrix augmented with the column that represents the right-hand sides of the equations:\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14071100/assets/8356d9148bc06d76a5aee41e4a07651c43d94b2496d9542eb8b6e01ee52ea161.png)" :db/ensure [:question/validate]}]
